    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni yaaja e Gaza, yaabonayo omukazi malaaya, yaaba naye mu buliri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ab'e Gaza baamanha ng'ali eyo. Kale baazingiza ekifo ekyo okukyezunguluza, era baamweteega ku mulyango gw'ekibuga obwire bwonabwona ng'abasiriikiriire, baakoba mule bati: “Obwire ka bukye memale tumwite.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Samusoni yalambaalaku kutuusa bwa mu bwire ghagati wonka. Yaasituka, yaagema endhigi edh'omulyango ogwingira mu kibuga n'emyango gyaku gyombi, yaadhikuukulagho n'ebisiba byaku n'ebidhiriku ebindi byonabyona. Olwo yaabbeedera endhigi edho ku mabega, yaadhitwala ku ntwiko y'olusozi olulingiriire Heburoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bwe byawa, Samusoni yaayenda omukazi mu kiiko ky'e Soreki, ng'eriina lye ni Delila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abakungu b'Abafilisiti baaja y'omukazi oyo, baamukoba bati: “Musendesende omanhe amaani ge amangi ghe gamuva, n'ensambo yetughanga okumugemamu ni tumusiba, amaani ago ni gamuwa. Olwo buli muntu ku ife aidha kukugha ebitundu bya feeza lukumi na kikumi (1,100) .”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Delila yaaja, yaakoba Samusoni ati: “Nkweghembye nkobera amaani go amangi ghe gakuva, n'engeri ole y'asobola okukugemamu n'akusiba, amaani ago ni gakuwaamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni yairamu ati: “Bwe bansibisa obugugha obuyaaka omusanvu obw'akalaso, obukaali kukala, mba munafu ng'oti n'omuntu owundi yeenayeena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abakungu b'Abafilisiti baaleetera Delila obugugha obuyaaka omusanvu obw'akalaso, obukaali kukala, yaabusibisa Samusoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delila oyo era yaliyo n'abasaadha nga bateeze mu kisenge eky'omunda. Agho yaaleekaana yaamukoba ati: “Samusoni, Abafilisiti bakugwireku!” Aye Samusoni yaakutula obugugha ng'oti n'ewuuzi bwe dhikutuka ng'omuliro gudhigemye. Kale, ekyama ekigema ku maani ge kyasigala nga kikaali kumanhibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delila yaakoba Samusoni ati: “Bona, oli kumbuzaabuza, waaloba kunkobera kituufu. Nkweghembye nkobera ole bw'aghanga okukusiba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni yaamukoba ati: “Bwe bansibisa emigugha emiyaaka egitakozesebwangaku, mba munafu ng'oti n'omuntu owundi yeenayeena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Delila yaagema emigugha emiyaaka, yaamusiba, yaamukoba ati: “Samusoni, Abafilisiti bakugwireku!” Abasaadha abaali nga beeteeze, baali mu kisenge eky'omunda. Aye Samusoni yaakutula emigugha ku mikono gye ng'oti wuuzi buwuuzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delila yaakoba Samusoni ati: “N'okutuusa buti oli kumbuzaabuza, waaloba kunkobera kituufu. Nkobera ole bw'aghanga okukusiba.” Yaamukoba ati: “Bw'oluka emiganda omusanvu egy'enviiri dhange ku mutwe, n'ogikalanguza n'ekifundwa ekisibiirwa ku nkondo, mba munafu ng'oti n'omuntu owundi yeenayeena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Samusoni bweyali ng'ali kutenduka, Delila yaaluka emiganda omusanvu egy'enviiri ku mutwe gwa Samusoni oyo, era yaagikalanguza n'ekifundwa ekisibiirwa ku nkondo. Agho yaamukoba ati: “Samusoni Abafilisiti bakugwireku!” Aye Samusoni yaasitukagho mu ndoolo, yaasikula ekifundwa ekisibiirwa ku nkondo, enviiri dhaasimulukuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Delila yaamukoba ati: “Osobola okukoba oti onhendha, ate nga omwoyo gwo tigundiiku naire? Waakambuzaabuza buti emikuzi giigino esatu, waaloba kunkobera amaani go amangi ghe gakuva.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delila oyo yaamudeebanga buli lunaku ng'amubuuza, okutuusa Samusoni lwe yeesinwa ekibitiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale yaamukobera byonabyona, ati: “Tibansalangaku nviiri ku mutwe, kuba ndi Munaziri okuviira irala mu nda ya maama. Enviiri dhange bwe badhisalaku, amaani gange ganvaaku, naaba munafu ng'oti n'omuntu owundi yeenayeena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delila bwe yabona nga Samusoni amaze okumukobera byonabyona, yaatuma y'abakungu b'Abafilisiti okubeeta, ng'akoba ati: “Mwire ku mukuzi guno gwonka, kuba ankobeire byonabyona.” Agho baidha y'ali nga n'empiiya bali nadho mu ngalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delila yaatenduukiriza Samusoni ng'amuleze ku mubiri, era yaayeta omusaadha yaasala emiganda omusanvu egy'enviiri dha Samusoni. Agho Delila yaatoolera okumudaazadaaza, amaani gaamuvaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaamukoba ati: “Samusoni, Abafilisiti bakugwireku!” Samusoni yaasitukagho mu ndoolo, yaakoba mule ati: “Ndidha kubeenhunhunkuzaaku nje, nga bwe mbairenga nkola ku mikuzi gire egindi.” Yali taidhi nga Musengwa Katonda amulekuliire agho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti baamugema, baamutundulamu amaiso. Era baamutwala e Gaza, baamusibisa endhegere edh'ekyuma eky'ekikomo, baamuta ku mulimo ogw'okuseeranga ku lubengo mu ikomera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye enviiri dhe dhaatoolera okwiraku okumera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakungu b'Abafilisiti beesoloza okusagambya n'okughaayo omusengo omukologho y'omusambwa gwaibwe Dagoni, nga bakoba bati: “Omusambwa gwaife gutughaire okughangula omuzigu waife Samusoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bwe baamubona baasaaka omusambwa gwaibwe bati: “Omusambwa gwaife gutughaire okughangula omuzigu waife, eyaitaitana ensi yaife era n'atwitaku abantu kamaala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho bwe baali nga bali kusagambya, baakoba bati: “Mwete Samusoni aidhe atusanhuseeku!” Kale baamuleeta okuva mu ikomera yaabasanhusa, baamwemereza ghagati gh'empango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Samusoni yaakoba omwisuka eyali amugemye ku mukono, ati: “Ka ngemeku mpulire empango edhigemereire endhu eno, nsobole okudheesiiraku.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endhu yali ng'ekubyeku abasaadha n'abakazi. N'abakungu boonaboona ab'Abafilisiti baali omwo. Era ghaigulu ku ngulu kwayo, kwona kwaliku abasaadha n'abakazi ng'oti enkumi isatu (3,000), abaali balingiriire Samusoni ng'ali kubasanhusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Samusoni yaasaba Musengwa Katonda ng'akoba ati: “Wo Musengwa Katonda wange, nkweghemba ondidhukire ompe amaani ku mukuzi guno gwonka. Olwo nsobole, mu kikolwa kino ekirala, okwesasuuliza ku Bafilisiti olw'okuntundulamu amaiso gange gombi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni yaagema empango dhombi edha ghagati, edhaali dhigemereire endhu eyo, yaadhimaliraku amaani ge goonagoona, omukono gwe omusaadha yaaguta ku yindi, n'omugooda ku yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakoba ati: “Ka nfiire ghalala n'Abafilisiti.” Yaasindika n'amaani ge goonagoona, endhu yaagwa ku bakungu ni ku bantu boonaboona abaali omwo. Kale, abantu Samusoni be yaita mu kufa kwe, baaba kamaala inho okusinga be yaita nga mulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
